<decision #typed-context-fact-authority apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?>变化中的 work context、Workflow stage context 与 provider projection 如何进入模型上下文而不改写既有前缀？</?>
  <recommendation ?>在现有 Conversation authority 中追加闭合、前驱绑定的 typed context facts；owner state 与 fact projection 分离。</?>
  <options {} [
    <option { key = "append-only-facts" recommended = true } (
      <title ?>Append-only typed facts</?>
      <description ?>状态仍由 Actor/Workflow owner 持有；只在 canonical value 变化时向 Conversation 追加带 revision、previous digest 与 closed payload 的 provider context fact。</?>
      <tradeoff ?>同 epoch 会保留 superseded facts，直到一次显式 compaction/epoch transition 收敛。</?>
    )>
    <option { key = "fixed-overlay" recommended = false } (
      <title ?>Replace fixed-boundary overlay</?>
      <description ?>继续在 system roots 后只投影最新动态状态。</?>
      <tradeoff ?>每次 revision 变化都会改写早期 bytes，破坏 DeepSeek exact-prefix 缓存。</?>
    )>
  ]>
  <answer (
    <raw-answer ?>选择 append-only typed facts，共享现有 Conversation Domain，不创建第二上下文 authority。</?>
    <decision-text ?>动态 owner state SHALL 通过 runtime-first projector 生成 immutable closed `ActorProviderContextFact` asset。`LocalConversationSessionActorBinding.providerContextFactHead` SHALL bind one Actor-global sequence/digest chain; append SHALL atomically create the content-addressed asset and CAS the head. 每个 namespace 仅允许 exact idempotent replay 或 revision `n+1` 且 namespace predecessor 命中；每个 fact 同时绑定 exact history anchor。materializer SHALL follow the chain and insert tagged machine-owned facts at their safe chronological user/text boundary, never system roots and never inside a pending tool pair。DeepSeek/OpenAI Chat、Responses 与 Anthropic SHALL each use the closed versioned wire table in design §6; adapters cannot relocate facts。unchanged value 不新增 fact；generic logic 不解释 Workflow payload。</?>
    <rationale ?>把 projection 变成 append-only事件可同时保持单一 owner、模型可见性和同 epoch prefix integrity；把最新状态插回前部无法满足缓存不变量。</?>
    <evidence ?>当前 `late_status` overlay、replace-in-place provider projection 与 G1 retained-prefix指标；G2 lifecycle facet/durable material authority。</?>
  )>
  <confidence ?>0.95</?>
  <reversibility ?>moderate</?>
)>

<decision #provider-context-epoch-transition-authority apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?>哪些变化可以改变既有 provider prefix，谁负责推进和验证 context epoch？</?>
  <recommendation ?>同 epoch receipt不可变；只有一个 Conversation-domain runtime-first transition Processor 可按 closed reason 与前驱 digest 单调推进。</?>
  <options {} [
    <option { key = "immutable-receipt-cas" recommended = true } (
      <title ?>Immutable receipt with CAS</?>
      <description ?>compaction、rewind/fork、provider/model/profile切换、显式资源或surface revision接受各产生一个 reason-bound receipt。</?>
      <tradeoff ?>所有非延伸写入点都必须接入同一个 transition seam。</?>
    )>
    <option { key = "same-epoch-reconcile" recommended = false } (
      <title ?>Reconcile within epoch</?>
      <description ?>源frontier变化后原地重算handoff与digest。</?>
      <tradeoff ?>epoch identity失去含义，恢复和缓存观测无法解释前缀变化。</?>
    )>
  ]>
  <answer (
    <raw-answer ?>使用不可变 receipt 与 monotonic CAS；reconcile 只验证，不修复。</?>
    <decision-text ?>Provider context epoch SHALL be owned by Conversation Domain. Immutable v2 receipt SHALL bind predecessor receipt digest、provider/model/profile、**epoch-baseline** history/prompt/fact heads、source frontier、pending delivery set、handoff、resource/surface digests、retention policy、closed reason与timestamp；ordinary append不得改写它。每个成功请求另追加 immutable `ProviderRequestAdmissionReceipt`，绑定 epoch receipt、previous admission、current descendant heads、fact range、final request digest与delivery confirmations。`reconcileActorProviderEpochProjection` SHALL validate current heads are descendants of baseline/latest admission. Any non-append divergence without transition SHALL fail before transport. One CAS command/event batch SHALL atomically bind expected prior heads/admission, next baseline heads, fact/delivery deltas, optional compaction proof and successor receipt；local persistence stages immutable material、fsyncs、publishes one head last。Compaction proof SHALL bind retained source facts、pair record digests、successful admission、successor facts and receipt，允许source pair在新epoch提交后删除。Fresh recovery reuses exact v2 receipt；corrupt/mismatched receipt fails closed。</?>
    <rationale ?>缓存 miss 只有在物理 prefix identity 与语义 epoch identity一一对应时才可解释、恢复和预算；原地reconcile会隐藏真实边界。</?>
    <evidence ?>当前 ProviderEpoch receipt在compaction/rewind后可同epoch更新；Mission G1要求所有非延伸变化都有持久reason。</?>
  )>
  <confidence ?>0.95</?>
  <reversibility ?>low</?>
)>

<decision #legacy-overlay-migration-policy apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?>已持久的 `late_status` work-context overlay、legacy Workflow stage/progress system prompt 与 v1 provider receipt 如何兼容？</?>
  <recommendation ?>只读旧格式，通过exact bounded importer一次投影为typed fact/新epoch；不双写、不从prompt猜Workflow授权。</?>
  <options {} [
    <option { key = "one-way-import" recommended = true } (
      <title ?>One-way exact import</?>
      <description ?>验证旧schema、唯一current overlay、Actor binding与receipt完整性，写新fact/receipt后停止旧格式。</?>
      <tradeoff ?>歧义、冲突或不完整legacy现场会fail closed，需要显式修复。</?>
    )>
    <option { key = "dual-read-write" recommended = false } (
      <title ?>Long-lived dual format</?>
      <description ?>同时维护overlay与typed fact。</?>
      <tradeoff ?>形成双authority并可能在恢复后再次重写prefix。</?>
    )>
  ]>
  <answer (
    <raw-answer ?>采用one-way exact import；old bytes只作为compatibility input。</?>
    <decision-text ?>Importer SHALL accept only contained persisted Conversation authority with one closed current `late_status` work-context overlay, exact Actor identity and a valid v1 receipt or no receipt. A CAS migration marker SHALL bind source tree/receipt digest, target fact/receipt digest and status. `initial_projection` maps only for pristine authority; `model_control` maps to `provider_model_profile_switch`; legacy recovery plus overlay becomes one `legacy_context_import` successor retaining the legacy reason. It SHALL append at most one typed fact and cease legacy writes. Legacy Workflow stage/progress prompt text SHALL be removed only as part of the already-authorized lifecycle Actor migration and SHALL NOT mint capability or stage truth. Multiple/conflicting overlays、unknown reason/fields、digest mismatch、symlink/path escape或interruption SHALL converge to the exact staged target or fail closed。</?>
    <rationale ?>旧会话需要恢复，但 prompt文字不能继续作为Workflow authority；one-way importer避免长期双写和隐藏prefix改写。</?>
    <evidence ?>G2 v3→v4 lifecycle importer与local immutable generation协议；当前 prompt generation late-status transform shape。</?>
  )>
  <confidence ?>0.9</?>
  <reversibility ?>low</?>
)>
